      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "卽召爲太子舍人。",
      "reading": "梁武帝召洽為太子舍人；殿本卽詔。",
      "note": "梁武帝召洽為太子舍人；殿本卽詔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 74,
      "end_codepoint": 82,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence3-82",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "御華光殿，詔洽及沆、蕭琛、任昉侍讌，賦二十韻詩，以洽辭爲工，賜絹二十匹。",
      "reading": "華光殿宴賦二十韻，洽作最工，獲絹二十匹；同席沆、蕭琛、任昉。",
      "note": "華光殿宴賦二十韻，洽作最工，獲絹二十匹；同席沆、蕭琛、任昉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 82,
      "end_codepoint": 118,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence3-118",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "高祖謂昉曰：「諸到可謂才子。」",
      "reading": "武帝稱諸到為才子。",
      "note": "武帝稱諸到為才子。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 118,
      "end_codepoint": 133,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence3-133",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "昉對曰：「臣常竊議，宋得其武，梁得其文。」",
      "reading": "昉以宋得其武、梁得其文答，句中不另具才子名單。",
      "note": "昉以宋得其武、梁得其文答，句中不另具才子名單。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 133,
      "end_codepoint": 154,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "二年，遷司徒主簿，直待詔省，敕使抄甲部書。",
      "reading": "天監二年遷司徒主簿，入待詔省，敕抄甲部書；南史詳十二卷。",
      "note": "天監二年遷司徒主簿，入待詔省，敕抄甲部書；南史詳十二卷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "五年，遷尚書殿中郎。",
      "reading": "五年遷尚書殿中郎。",
      "note": "五年遷尚書殿中郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-31",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "洽兄弟羣從，遞居此職，時人榮之。",
      "reading": "兄弟群從先後居殿中郎；南史到沆傳有三人相代。",
      "note": "兄弟群從先後居殿中郎；南史到沆傳有三人相代。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 47,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-47",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "七年，遷太子中舍人，與庶子陸倕對掌東宮管記。",
      "reading": "七年遷太子中舍人，與陸倕分掌東宮管記。",
      "note": "七年遷太子中舍人，與陸倕分掌東宮管記。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 47,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-69",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "俄爲侍讀，侍讀省仍置學士二人，洽復充其選。",
      "reading": "任侍讀，復入新置兩學士之一。",
      "note": "任侍讀，復入新置兩學士之一。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-90",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "九年，遷國子博士，奉敕撰《太學碑》。",
      "reading": "九年為國子博士，撰太學碑。",
      "note": "九年為國子博士，撰太學碑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 108,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-108",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "十二年，出爲臨川內史，在郡稱職。",
      "reading": "十二年出臨川內史。",
      "note": "十二年出臨川內史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 108,
      "end_codepoint": 124,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-124",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "十四年，入爲太子家令，遷給事黃門侍郎，兼國子博士。",
      "reading": "十四年太子家令、給事黃門侍郎，兼國子博士。",
      "note": "十四年太子家令、給事黃門侍郎，兼國子博士。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 124,
      "end_codepoint": 149,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-149",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "十六年，行太子中庶子。",
      "reading": "十六年行太子中庶子。殿本作遷。",
      "note": "十六年行太子中庶子。殿本作遷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 149,
      "end_codepoint": 160,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-160",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "普通元年，以本官領博士。",
      "reading": "普通元年以本官領博士。",
      "note": "普通元年以本官領博士。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 160,
      "end_codepoint": 172,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-172",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "頃之，入爲尚書吏部郎，請託一無所行。",
      "reading": "為尚書吏部郎，不通請託。",
      "note": "為尚書吏部郎，不通請託。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 172,
      "end_codepoint": 190,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-190",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "俄遷員外散騎常侍，復領博士，母憂去職。",
      "reading": "遷員外散騎常侍，領博士，以母憂離職。",
      "note": "遷員外散騎常侍，領博士，以母憂離職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 190,
      "end_codepoint": 209,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-209",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "五年，復爲太子中庶子，領步兵校尉，未拜，仍遷給事黃門侍郎，領尚書左丞。",
      "reading": "普通五年太子中庶子領步兵校尉，未拜即徙給事黃門侍郎領尚書左丞。",
      "note": "普通五年太子中庶子領步兵校尉，未拜即徙給事黃門侍郎領尚書左丞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 209,
      "end_codepoint": 244,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-244",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "準繩不避貴戚，尚書省賄賂莫敢通。",
      "reading": "為左丞執法及貴戚，省中莫敢通賄。",
      "note": "為左丞執法及貴戚，省中莫敢通賄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 244,
      "end_codepoint": 260,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-260",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "時鑾輿欲親戎，軍國容禮，多自洽出。",
      "reading": "武帝欲親征，軍國禮儀多出洽手。",
      "note": "武帝欲親征，軍國禮儀多出洽手。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 260,
      "end_codepoint": 277,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-277",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "六年，遷御史中丞，彈糾無所顧望，號爲勁直，當時肅清。",
      "reading": "普通六年遷御史中丞，以彈糾見稱。",
      "note": "普通六年遷御史中丞，以彈糾見稱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 277,
      "end_codepoint": 303,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-303",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "以公事左降，猶居職。",
      "reading": "以公事降秩，仍居原職。",
      "note": "以公事降秩，仍居原職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 303,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-313",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "舊制，中丞不得入尚書下舍，洽兄溉爲左民尚書，洽引服親不應有礙，刺省詳決。",
      "reading": "兄溉為左民尚書，洽以服親請定能否入尚書下舍。南史作左戶，梁書溉傳亦載左民。",
      "note": "兄溉為左民尚書，洽以服親請定能否入尚書下舍。南史作左戶，梁書溉傳亦載左民。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 349,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-349",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "左丞蕭子雲議許入溉省，亦以其兄弟素篤，不能相別也。",
      "reading": "左丞蕭子雲議許入溉省。",
      "note": "左丞蕭子雲議許入溉省。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 349,
      "end_codepoint": 374,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence4-374",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "七年，出爲貞威將軍、雲麾長史、尋陽太守。",
      "reading": "七年貞威將軍、雲麾長史、尋陽太守。",
      "note": "七年貞威將軍、雲麾長史、尋陽太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 374,
      "end_codepoint": 394,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "大通元年，卒於郡，時年五十一。",
      "reading": "大通元年卒郡，年五十一。",
      "note": "大通元年卒郡，年五十一。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 15,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-15",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "贈侍中。",
      "reading": "身後贈侍中，陳書其子傳略稱梁侍中。",
      "note": "身後贈侍中，陳書其子傳略稱梁侍中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 15,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "諡曰理子。",
      "reading": "諡理子。",
      "note": "諡理子。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-24",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "昭明太子與晉安王綱令曰：「明北兗、到長史遂相系凋落，傷怛悲惋，不能已已。",
      "reading": "昭明太子致其弟晉安王綱，明北兗指山賓，到長史指洽。",
      "note": "昭明太子致其弟晉安王綱，明北兗指山賓，到長史指洽。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 60,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-60",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "去歲陸太常殂歿，今茲二賢長謝。",
      "reading": "與先一年卒的陸太常倕分錄。",
      "note": "與先一年卒的陸太常倕分錄。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 60,
      "end_codepoint": 75,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-75",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "陸生資忠履貞，冰清玉潔，文該四始，學遍九流，高情勝氣，貞然直上。",
      "reading": "陸生為倕，此下評其文學操守。",
      "note": "陸生為倕，此下評其文學操守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 75,
      "end_codepoint": 107,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-107",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "明公儒學稽古，淳厚篤誠，立身行道，始終如一，儻值夫子，必升孔堂。",
      "reading": "稱明山賓行儒學，夫子、孔堂為設想譬喻。",
      "note": "稱明山賓行儒學，夫子、孔堂為設想譬喻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 107,
      "end_codepoint": 139,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-139",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "到子風神開爽，文義可觀，當官蒞事，介然無私。",
      "reading": "到子為洽，評其風神、文義與居官公正。",
      "note": "到子為洽，評其風神、文義與居官公正。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 139,
      "end_codepoint": 161,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-161",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "皆海內之俊乂，東序之秘寶。",
      "reading": "合稱諸人為東序之珍。",
      "note": "合稱諸人為東序之珍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 161,
      "end_codepoint": 174,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-174",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
      "source_quote": "此之嗟惜，更復何論。",
      "reading": "申說嗟惜。",
      "note": "申說嗟惜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 174,
      "end_codepoint": 184,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-daoqia-complete:received_sentence5-184",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "4mr_j4p_k5h",
